{"id": 19765, "group": "campus-iit-indore-placements", "sent_at": "2026-11-03T11:07:28.939119+00:00", "text": "For AWT - There were 2 sql questions , first was something like to get employees having higher salary than the average salary in their department , 2nd was related to usage of LAG like we had to find months that had higher cost value than previous month. We had apti questions like that of speed distance , number pattern , coding decoding they were easy and also had some 4-5 finance mcqs related to bonds , stocks and wacc", "author_tag": "IITI", "reply_to": {"id": 19687, "text": "Blackrock oa pattern?", "author_tag": "IITG"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
